<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>SEMMERING, Austria 1996-12-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first leg</p>
<p>times in a women's Alpine skiing World Cup slalom on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) 52.13 seconds</p>
<p>2. Elfi Eder (Austria) 52.87</p>
<p>3. Patricia Chauvet (France) 52.97</p>
<p>4. Gabriela Zingre-Graf (Switzerland) 53.40</p>
<p>5. Anita Wachter (Austria) 53.42</p>
<p>6. Claudia Riegler (New Zealand) 53.45</p>
<p>7. Marlies Oester (Switzerland) 53.65</p>
<p>8. Karin Roten (Switzerland) 53.72</p>
<p>9. Ylva Nowen (Sweden) 53.85</p>
<p>10. Martina Accola (Switzerland) 53.89</p>
</text>
